<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">Daniel</book>
  <para style="h">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniel</para>
  <para style="mt">Daniel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Jehoiakima rorêl kum thumnaah chuan Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara Jerusalem-ah a lo kal a, a hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Juda lal Jehoiakima chu a kutah a pe a, Pathian in bungbêl ṭhenkhatte nên; tin, ani chuan Sinar rama a pathian inah a kalpui ta a; tin, bungbêlte chu a pathian sum inah a rawn thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Israel fate zînga mi, lal thlahte leh mi ṭha fate, tleirâwl demna awm lo, hmêl ṭha tak, finna tinrênga remhria, hriatna lama bengvâr, thil bul chhût thiam, lal ina chetla thiam rawn hruai lût tûr leh, Kaldai ṭawng leh thil thiam zirtîr tûrin, a mi tilrehte hotu Aspenaza chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan lal chaw tui hmêl ata leh a uain in ṭhin ata chu an ni tin chan tûr a ruatsak a, chutianga kum thum châwma, chumi tâwpa lal hmaa an din theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, hêng zîngah hian Juda fate zînga mi, Daniela te, Hanania te, Misaela te, Azaria te an tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, tilrehte hotu chuan an hming a sa hlawm a; Daniela chu Beltesazzara a vuah a, Hanania chu Sadraka, Misaela chu Mesaka, Azaria chu Abednegoa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahse, Daniela chuan a rilruin lal chaw leh a uain in ṭhinte chuan intihbawlhhlawh loh a tum tlat a; chutichuan, a intihbawlhhlawh loh nân tilrehte hotu chu a dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathianin Daniela chu tilrehte hotu laka duhsakna leh khawngaihna chu a dawntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, tilrehte hotu chuan Daniela hnênah, “In ei tûr leh in in tûr ruattu ka lalpa, lalber chu ka hlau a ni; in hmêl hi tleirâwl, in rualpuite aia chhe zâwkin an rawn hmu ang asin! Chuti a nih chuan lalber lakah ka lû hi hlauhpuiawmin in siam dâwn a ni alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, tilrehte hotuin Daniela te, Hanania te, Misaela te, Azaria te enkawltua a siam hnênah chuan Danielan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ka ngên a che, i chhiahhlawhte hi ni sâwm min fiah rawh, ei tûr thlai leh in tûr tuisik min pe mai rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, i hmaa kan lan dânte leh lal chaw tui hmêl ei tleirâwlte lan dân chu tehkhin ni sela; tin, i hmuh dân angin i chhiahhlawhte chungah hian ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, he thu hi a remtihsak a, anni chu ni sâwm a fiah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ni sâwm tâwpah chuan lal chaw tui hmêl eitu tleirâwlte zawng zawng ai chuan an hmêl a lang mawi zâwkin an lo thau zâwk mah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, enkawltu chuan an ei tûr leh an uain in tûr chu a la bo va, thlai a pe ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, hêng tleirâwl palite hi chu thiamna leh finna zawng zawngah hriatna leh bengvârna Pathianin a pe a, Daniela chuan inlârna leh mumang zawng zawng a hre thiam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, lalin anmahni rawn hruai luhna tûra a ni ruat tâwpah chuan tilrehte hotu chuan anniho chu Nebukadnezzara hmaah chuan a rawn hruai lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a lo be hlawm a, anniho zîngah chuan Daniela te, Hanania te, Misaela te, Azaria te ang rêng rêng an awm lo va; chuvângin, lal hmaah chuan an ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, finna leh hriat thiamna thu tinrêng lalin a han zawh chuan a ram pum puia dawivaihthiam leh aikaihthiam zawng zawngte ai chuan a lêt sâwmin an ṭha zâwk tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Daniela chuan Lal Kura kum khatna thlengin a thawk ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Nebukadnezzara rorêl kum hnihnaah chuan Nebukadnezzara chuan mumang a nei a; a rilru a lo buai zo ta a, a muhîl thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chuan a mumang chu amah hrilh tûrin dawivaihthiamte, aikaihthiamte, dawithiamte, Kaldai mite koh thu a pe a. Tichuan, an lo kal a, lal hmaah chuan an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan an hnênah, “Mumang ka nei a, chu mumang chu hre tûrin ka rilru a buai zo ta a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kaldai mite chuan Suria ṭawngin lal hnênah chuan, “Aw lalber, kumkhuain dam ang che! I mumang chu i chhiahhlawhte hi hrilh la; tin, a hrilhfiahna chu kan entîr dâwn che nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal chuan Kaldai mite chu a chhâng a, an hnênah, “Ka hnên aṭangin thu chu a chhuak tawh alâwm: mumang leh a hrilhfiahna chu ka hnênah in tihlan loh nâ chuan sah sawm in ni ang a, in inte pawh hnâwmhnawkah siam a ni mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mumang leh a hrilhfiahna in tihlan erawh chuan ka hnên ata thilpêk leh lâwmman leh chawimawina ropui tak in hmu ang; chuvângin, mumang leh a hrilhfiahna chu mi entîr rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anni chuan an chhâng leh a, “Lal chuan chu mumang chu a chhiahhlawhte hi min hrilh sela; tin, a hrilhfiahna chu kan entîr ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal chuan a chhâng a, “Hun in tisei lui mai mai dâwn a ni tih chiang takin ka hria;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ka hnên aṭangin thu chu a chhuak tawh tih in hria e: ka hnêna mumang chu in tihlan loh nâ chuan in tân dân khat chauh a awm: Dâwt sawi kuala, ka hmaa sawi tûr dâwt thu leh thu tlâktlâi lo in buatsaih a nih hi. Chutichuan, mumang chu mi hrilh ula, a hrilhfiahna pawh chu mi entîr thei tih ka hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kaldai mite chuan lal chu an chhâng a, “Lal thil phût hi entîr thei tûr mi pakhat mah lei chungah hian an awm lo ve; lal te, hotu te, rorêltu te tu mah rêngin hetiang thil hi dawivaihthiam emaw, aikaihthiam emaw, Kaldai mi emaw an la zâwt ngai si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, lal thil phût hi thil khirh tak a ni a, tîsaa khawsa lo pathiante tih chauh lo chu entîr thei tûr tu mah an awm lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan lal chu a thinrim êm êm a, a kawlh ta hle mai a, Babulon mi fing zawng zawng chu tihboral vek tûr thu a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, thupêk chu a chhuak ta a, mi finghote chu tihhlum tûr an ni ta a; tin, Daniela leh a ṭhiante pawh tihhlum tûrin an zawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Daniela chuan Babulon mi fingte tihlum tûra kal chhuak Arioka, lal vêngtu pâwl hotu chu remhre tak leh fing takin a chhâng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />lal vêngtu pâwl hotu Arioka hnênah chuan, “Engtizia nge lal thupêk chu chuti êma a hmanhmawh le?” tiin a chhâng a. Tin, Arioka chuan Daniela chu a hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Daniela chu a lût a, lal chu a hrilhfiahna a entîr theih nân hun pe tûrin a ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Daniela chu a inah a hâwng a, chu thil chu a ṭhian Hanania te, Misaela te, Azaria te a hrilh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Babulon mi fing dangte zînga Daniela leh a ṭhiante chu an boral ve loh nâna, he thu inthup chungchângah hian vân Pathian khawngaihna an dîlna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, chu thu inthup chu zân inlârnaah Daniela hnênah a lang ta a. Tin, Daniela chuan vân Pathian chu a fak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Daniela chuan, “Pathian hming chu kumkhaw tlaitluanin fakin awm rawh se; Finna leh thiltihtheihna a ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hunte leh hunbite a tidanglam a; Lalte a sawn bo va, lalte a tungding a. Mi fing hnênah finna a pe a, Hre thiamtu hnênah hriatna a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thil thûk leh thil inthupte a tilang a; Thima awm pawh a hria a, a hnênah chuan êng a chêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw ka thlahtute Pathian, finna leh theihna mi petu, I lak ata kan thil dîl tûna mi hriattîrtu chu Lâwm thu ka hrilhin ka fak a che; Lal thil phût chu min hriattîr tawh si a,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, Daniela chu Babulon mi fingte tiboral tûra lalin a ruat Arioka hnênah chuan a va kal a, a hnênah chuan, “Babulon mi fingte chu tiboral suh; lal hmaah chuan mi hruai la, lal hnênah chuan a hrilhfiahna ka entîr ang e,” a va ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Arioka chuan Daniela chu hmanhmawh takin lal hmaah a hruai ta a, a hnênah, “Juda sal fate zîngah lal hnêna a hrilhfiahna hriattîrtu tûr mi pakhat ka hmu ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lal chuan Daniela, a hming Beltesazzara hnênah chuan, “Mumang ka neih leh a hrilhfiahna chu ka hnênah mi hriattîr thei em ni?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Daniela chuan lal chu a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Thil inthup, lalin hriat a duh chu, mi fingte, aikaihthiamte, dawivaihthiamte, aisânthiamte chuan lal hnênah an entîr thei lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />mahse, thil inthupte puangtu Pathian chu vânah a awm a, Lal Nebukadnezzara hi tûn hnua thil lo la awm tûrte chu a hriattîr a nih hi. I mumang leh i khumlaizâwla i lua inlârnate chu hêng hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />aw lalber, nang chuan i khumlaizâwlah chuan tûn hnua thil lo awm tûrte i ngaihtuah a, thil inthupte puang ṭhîntu chuan tûn hnua thil lo la awm tûrte chu a hriattîr che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, kei hian mi dangte aia finna ka neih bîk avânga he thil inthup hi ka hnêna puan a ni lo va, lal hnênah a hrilhfiahna hriattîr tûrin a ni zâwk e, i thinlunga i ngaihtuahte chu i hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aw lalber, i han dâk chhuak a, ngai teh, milim ropui tak a lo awm a. Chu milim hrawl pui, tle êm êm mai chu i hmaah a ding a; a lan dân pawh ṭihbaiawm tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chu milim chu a lû rangkachak thianghlim tak a ni a, a âwm leh a bânte chu tangkarua, a pum leh a malpuite dâr,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />a kête thîr, a kephah chu a ṭhen thîr, a ṭhen bellei a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nang chuan i thlîr reng laiin lung, kut lova laih chhuah chuan milim chu a kephah thir leh belleiah chuan a rawn delh a, a tikeh sawm ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, thîr te, bellei te, dâr te, tangkarua te, rangkachak te chu a rualin a keh sawm ta vek a, nipui lai hruih zâwla buhsî ang mai an lo ni ta a; tin, thliin anmahni a lên bo va, an awmna hmun rêng hriat a ni ta lo va. Tin, milim delhtu lung chu tlâng lian takah a lo chang a, lei pum hi a khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hei hi mumang chu a ni a; tin, a hrilhfiahna chu lal hmaah hian kan han sawi leh ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aw lalber, nang hi lalte lal, vân Pathianin ram te, thiltihtheihna te, chakna te, ropuina te a pêka chu i ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />chuvângin, khawiah pawh mihring fate awmna apiangah ramsa te, chunglêng sava te i kutah a pe a, an zaa chungah rorêl tûrin a siam chia; rangkachak lû chu nang hi i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, i hnuah hian ram dang, nang aia tênau zâwk a lo ding ang; tin, dâr, ram thumna, lei chung zawng zawnga rorêl tûr chu a awm leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, ram lina chu thîr anga khauh a ni ang; thîr chuan a tikeh sawmin thil zawng zawng a hneh ṭhîn ang hian; tin, thîrin thil zawng zawng a tikeh ang bawkin ani chuan a tikeh sawmin a râwt dip ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, a kephah leh a zungṭangte chu, a ṭhen bêlvawtu hlum, a ṭhen thîr nia i hmuh ang ngei khân ram inṭhen a ni ang a; mahse, amahah chuan thîr khauhna chu a awm tho vang, thîr leh hlum nêm inpawlh i hmuh ang ngei khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, a kezungṭang a ṭhen thîr, a ṭhen hlum a ni ang bawk khân ram chu a ṭhenah chuan a chak ang a, a ṭhenah chuan a chhe awl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, thîr leh hlum nêm inpawlh i hmuh ang ngei khân anni chu mihring chiin an inpawlh ang a; mahse, thîr leh hlum a inpawlh tak tak thei lo ang bawkin an inzawm reng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, chûng lalte nîah chuan vân Pathianin ram a rawn din ang a, chu chu a chhe ngai tawh lo vang a, a lalna pawh mi dangte tân hnutchhiah a ni hek lo vang; hêng ram zawng zawngte hi a tikeh sawmin a tiral zâwk ang a, kumkhuain a ding reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tlâng ata lung, kut lova laih chhuahin thîr te, dâr te, hlum te, tangkarua te, rangkachak te a tikeh sawm i hmuh ang ngei khân, Pathian ropui tak chuan lal hnênah hian tûn hnua thil lo awm tûr chu a puang a ni e. Mumang chu a tak ngei a, a hrilhfiahna pawh a dik ngei a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tichuan, Lal Nebukadnezzara chu a bawkkhup a, Daniela chu chibai a bûk a, a hnênah chuan thilhlan leh rimtuite rawn hlân tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Lal chuan Daniela chu a chhâng a, a hnênah, “He thil inthup i puan theihziaah hian in Pathian chu pathiante Pathian, lalte Lal, thil inthup puangtu a lo ni ngei mai e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chuan Daniela chu a siam lian a, thilpêk ropui tam tak a pe a, Babulon ram bial pum puia rorêl tûr leh Babulon mi fingte zawng zawng chunga hotu ber ni tûrin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, Daniela dîl angin lal chuan Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te chu Babulon bial chungchânga hotuah a dah a; Daniela erawh chu lalber rorêlnaah chuan a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Nebukadnezzara chuan rangkachak milim, a sân lam tawng sawmruk, a hlai lam tawng ruk a siam a, Babulon biala Dura phaizâwlah a dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lal Nebukadnezzara chuan thuneitute, aiawhtute, awptute, rorêltute, sum enkawltute, remruattute, dânhremite leh ram bial rorêltu zawng zawng chu Lal Nebukadnezzara milim din hlannaa lo tel tûr chuan a chah khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, thuneitute, aiawhtute, awptute, rorêltute, sum enkawltute, remruattute, dânhremite leh ram bial rorêltu zawng zawng chu Lal Nebukadnezzara milim din serhnaah chuan an rawn inkhâwm a, Lal Nebukadnezzara milim din hmaah chuan an ding hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ring takin tlângau a lo au va, “Aw, mi tinte u, hnam tinte u, ṭawng tinte u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tawtawrâwt te, phênglâwng te, ṭingṭang te, sakbut te, ṭingṭangpui te, baja te leh ri thei chi zawng zawng in hriat hunah, Lal Nebukadnezzara rangkachak milim din chu bawkkhupa chibai bûk tûrin thu pêk in ni e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tin, tu pawh bawkkhupa chibai bûk lo chu chumi lai la la chuan rawh tuina meipuia paih luh tûr an ni ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan chumi laia mipui zawng zawngin tawtawrâwt te, phênglâwng te, ṭingṭang te, sakbut te, ṭingṭangpui te leh ri thei chi zawng zawng an han hriat chuan mi tinte, hnam tinte, ṭawng tinte zawng zawng chuan Lal Nebukadnezzara rangkachak milim din chu bawkkhupin chibai an bûk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai chuan Kaldai mi ṭhenkhatte an lo hnai a, Juda mite chu an rawn hêk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal Nebukadnezzara hnênah chuan, “Aw lalber, kumkhuain dam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangin, aw lalber, mi tu pawh tawtawrâwt te, phênglâwng te, ṭingṭang te, sakbut te, ṭingṭangpui te, baja te leh ri thei chi zawng zawng hria apiang chuan bawkkhupin rangkachak milim chibai an bûk tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tin, tu pawh bawkkhupa chibai bûk lo apiang rawh tuina meipuia paih luh an ni ang, tiin thupêk i siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Juda mi ṭhenkhat Babulon ram bial chungchânga hotua i siam Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te kha an awm a, hêng mite hian, aw lalber, an pawisa lo che a ni. I pathiante rawng an bâwl lo va, rangkachak milim i din chu chibai an bûk hek lo,” tiin an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Nebukadnezzara chuan thinur leh thintâwt takin Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te chu rawn hruai tûr thu a pe a. Tin, hêng mite hi lal hmaah chuan an rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nebukadnezzara chuan a chhâl a, an hnênah, “Aw Sadrak, Mesak, Abednego, ka pathian rawng bâwl lova, ka rangkachak milim din chibai bûk loh hi in tum rêng em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûnah hian tawtawrâwt te, phênglâwng te, ṭingṭang te, sakbut te, ṭingṭangpui te, baja te leh ri thei chi zawng zawng in hriat hunah bawkkhupa ka milim siam chibai bûk tûr in nih tawh chuan a ṭha e! Chibai in bûk loh erawh chuan, chumi lai la la chuan rawh tuina meipuia paih luh in ni ang. Ka kut ata chhan chhuak tûr che u pathian chu tu a ni nge?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te chuan lal chu an chhâng a, a hnênah, “Aw Nebukadnezzar, he thûah hian kan chhân che pawh a ngai lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kan Pathian, a rawng kan bâwl ṭhina chuan rawh tuina meipui ata min chhan chhuak thei si a, i kut ata pawh, aw lalber, min chhan chhuak mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuti lo pawh ni sela, aw lalber, i pathiante rawng chu kan bâwl dâwn lo va, i rangkachak milim din pawh chu chibai kan bûk hek lo vang tih hi hria ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Nebukadnezzara chu a thin a tâwt ta êm êm a, Sadraka te Mesaka te, Abednegoa te lakah chuan a hmêl lan dân a dang zo ta a; rawh tuina mei chu a sat dân pângngai lêt sariha tisa tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a sipai rual zînga mi chak ṭhenkhatte chu Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te phuar tûr leh rawh tuina meipuia theh lût tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, hêng mite hi an kawrfualte, an kawrhnuaite, an diarte leh an silhfên dangte chawpa phuarin rawh tuina meipuia theh luh an ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, lal thupêk chu a hmanhmawh êm avâng leh rawh tuina mei chu a sat khawp avângin Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te chawi kângtute chu mei alh chuan a tihlum ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, hêng mi pathum - Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te hi phuar chungin rawh tuina meipui laiah chuan an tlu reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Lal Nebukadnezzara chuan mak a ti a, hmanhmawh takin a tho va, a remruatpuitute hnênah chuan, “Mi pathumte kha phuarin meiah kan theh lût a ni lâwm ni kha?” tiin a sawi a. Lal chu an chhâng a, a hnênah, “Aw lalber, theh lût e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani chuan, “En teh u, mi pali, phelha mei laia vei veia, na hauh lovin ka hmu a; a palina lan dân phei chu pathiante fapa ang a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, Nebukadnezzara chu rawh tuina meipui kawngkaah chuan a va kal hnai a, “Sadrak, Mesak, Abednego, nangni Chungnungbera Pathian bâwihte u, lo chhuak ula, hetah lo kal rawh u,” tiin a han bia a. Tichuan, Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te chu mei zîng ata chu an lo chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, thuneitute, aiawhtute, awptute leh lal remruatpuitute rawn inkhâwm chuan, hêng mite taksa chungah hian meiin thiltihtheihna a nei lo va, an sam pawh a kâng kir lo va, an kawrfualte a danglam lo va, mei rim rêng rêng pawh an nam hek lo tih an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lal Nebukadnezzara chuan thu a sawi a, “Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se; ani chuan a vântirhkoh a rawn tîr a, a chhiahhlawh, amah ringtute chu a chhan chhuak a, chûng mite chuan an Pathian chauh lo chu pathian dang rêng rawng an bâwl lohva, chibai an bûk loh nân, lal thupêk tidanglamin an taksa an hlân ngam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi tin, hnam tin, ṭawng tin, Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te Pathian chunga thu ṭha lo sawi apiang chu sah sawm an ni ang a, an inte chu hnâwmhnawkah siam a ni mai ang tih thupêk ka siam e; hetiang taka chhan chhuak thei pathian dang rêng rêng an awm si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chuan Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te chu Babulon bialah chuan a tilian ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Nebukadnezzara chuan mi tinte, hnam tinte, ṭawng tinte zawng zawng, lei pum puia chêngte hnênah chuan: in chungah remna tihpunin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chungnung ber Pathianin ka hnêna thil entîrnate, thilmak a tih tâkte hi tihlan ṭha ka ti e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thil entîrnate chu a ropuiin, a thiltih makte chu a va nasa êm! A ram chu ram hlun a ni a, a rorêlna chu chhuan awm chhûng zawng zawng a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei, Nebukadnezzara hi ka inah nuamsa tak leh ka in ropuiah neinung takin ka awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mumang ka hlauh zâwng tak ka nei a; ka khumlaizâwla ka suangtuahna leh ka lua inlârna chuan mi tibuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Babulon mi fing zawng zawngte chu ka mumang hrihfiahna mi hriattîr theih nân, ka hmaa rawn hruai tûrin thu ka pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, dawivaihthiamte, aikaihthiamte, Kaldai mite, aisânthiamte chu an lo kal a; tin, ka mumang chu ka hrilh a; mahse, a hrilhfiahna rêng chu min hriattîr lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahse, a tâwp berah chuan Daniela, ka pathian hming ang pu, a hming Beltesazzara, amaha pathian thianghlimte thlarau awm chu ka hmaah a lo kal a; tin, ka mumang chu ka hrilh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Aw Beltesazzar, dawivaihthiamte hotu, nangmahah chuan pathian thianghlimte thlarau a awm tih leh, thurûk rêng rêngin a tibuai lo che tih ka hriat avângin, ka mumanga ka hmuh inlârna leh a hrilhfiahna chu mi hrilh teh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka khumlaizâwla ka lua inlârnate chu hetiang hi a ni: ka han dâk chhuak a, ngai teh, lei lai takah thing a lo awm a, a sânzia chu a nasa khawp mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thing chu a ṭhang a, a ṭanṭha a, a sân lam chuan vân a tawng a, kâwlkil aṭangin a lang thei vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hnahte chu a mawiin a rahte a tam a, amahah chuan nung zawng zawng tân ei tûr a awm a; ramsate chuan a hlim an bêl a, chunglêng savate chu a zârahte an chêng a, tîsa pu zawng zawng chu ama châwm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka khumlaizâwla ka lua inlârnaah chuan ka han en a, ngai teh, vân aṭangin vêngtu, mi thianghlim chu a lo chhuk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ring takin, ‘Thing chu kit la, a zârte chu hlawi la, a hnahte thing thla la, a rahte tidarh rawh; a hnuai ata ramsate chu kal bo sela, a zâr ata chunglêng savate pawh thlâwk bo rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ram hlobet ṭo zîngah, leia a bulbâwr chu, thîr leh dâra ṭâwnin zuah la; tin, vân daiin huh sela, a chan tûr chu ramsate nêna hlobet zînga awm ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A rilru chu mihring rilru aṭanga tihdanglam ni se, a hnênah ramsa rilru pêk ni rawh se; a chungah hun sarih ral rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />He thutlûkna hi vêngtute thupêka tih a ni a, thil phût hi mi thianghlimte thûa tih a ni, Chungnungbera chuan mihringte lalna ram chungah thu a nei a, a duhsak apiang a pe a, mi hnuaihnung berte pawh a luahtîr ṭhîn a ni tih mi nungin an hriat nân a ni,’ tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />He mumang hi kei, Lal Nebukadnezzaran ka nei a; tin, nang aw Beltesazzar, a hrilhfiahna chu puang rawh. Ka rama mi fing zawng zawng chuan a hrilhfiahna chu mi hriattîr thei si lo va; nang erawh chuan i thei e, nangmahah chuan pathian thianghlimte thlarau chu a awm si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Daniela, a hming Beltesazzara chu a han chîai hle rih a, a ngaihtuahte chuan a tibuai a. Lal chuan a hnênah, “Beltesazzar, mumang emaw, a hrilhfiahna emaw pawhin tibuai che suh se,” tiin a sawi a. Beltesazzara chuan a hnênah, “Ka lalpa, mumang chu a hawtu che tân ni sela, a hrilhfiahna pawh chu i hmêlmate tân ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thing i hmuh, lo ṭhanga, lo ṭanṭhaa, vân lo tawnga, kâwlkil aṭanga lang thei vek leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a hnahte mawia, a rahte tama, nung zawng zawng tâna ei tûr awm leh a hnuaia ramsate chênga, a zârte chunglêng savate chênna lo ni chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />aw lalber, nangmah i ni a; i ṭhang a, i chak a, i ropuina chu a ṭhang a, vân a tawng a, i rorêlnate chu kâwlkil thleng a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, vân aṭanga vêngtu mi thianghlim lo chhuka, ‘Thing chu kit la, tiboral rawh; amaherawhchu, ram hlobet ṭo zîngah, leia a bulbâwr chu thîr leh dâra ṭâwnin zuah la; tin, vân daiin huh sela, a chan tûr chu ramsate nêna awm ni rawh se, a chunga hun sarih a ral thlengin,’ rawn ti lalin a hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tin, a hrilhfiahna chu hei hi a ni, aw lalber, Chungnungbera thupêk, lalber ka lalpa chunga lo thleng chu a ni e:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />mihring zîng ata hnawh chhuah i ni ang a, i chênna chu ramsate zîngah a ni ang a, sebâwng anga hlobet eitîr i ni ang a, vân daiin i huh ang a, i chungah hun sarih a ral ang; Chungnungbera chuan mihringte lalna ram chungah thu a nei a, a duhsak apiang a pe ṭhîn a ni tih i hriat hma loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, a bulbâwr zuah tûra thu an lo pêk ang khân, vânin thu a nei tih i hriat hnuah chuan i ram chu i ta a ni tlat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, aw lalber, ka thurâwn che hi pawm tlâkah ngai la, i sualna chu felnain thlâk la, i suahsualnate chu mi rethei chunga zahngaihnain thlâk rawh, i nunkhaw nawmna hi a sei thei deuh mahna,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng hi Lal Nebukadnezzara chungah chuan a lo thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thla sâwm leh thla hnih tâwpah chuan Babulon lal in chungah lal chu a vei a vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lal chuan, “He Babulon ropui hi keima chakna ngeia lal chênna hmun atân leh ka ropuina mawina tûra ka siam chu a ni lo vem ni?” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chu thu chu lal kâa a chhuah lai mêkin vân aṭangin aw a lo chhuak a: “Aw Lal Nebukadnezzar, i hnênah thu a lo thleng e: lalna ram chuan a hransan ta che a ni!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihring zîng ata hnawh chhuah i ni ang a, i chênna chu ramsate zîngah a ni ang; sebâwng anga hlobet eitîr i ni ang a, i chungah hun sarih a ral ang; Chungnungbera chuan mihringte lalna ram chungah thu a nei a, a duhsak apiang hnênah a pe ṭhîn a ni tih i hriat hma loh chuan,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chumi lai la la chuan chu thil chu Nebukadnezzara chungah a lo thleng ta nghâl a; mihring zîng ata hnawh chhuahin a awm ta a, sebâwng angin hlobet a ei a; a taksa chu vân daia huhin a awm a, a samte mupui hmul anga a ṭhan leh, a tinte sava tin ang mai a nih thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, chûng ni tâwpah chuan kei, Nebukadnezzara chuan vân lamah ka mit ka lên chho va, ka hriatna chu ka hnênah a lo kîr leh ta a. Chungnungbera chu mal ka sâwm a, nung renga chu ka fak a, ka zah a, a rorêlna chu chatuan rorêlna a ni a, a ram chu chhuan awm chhûng zawng zawng a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Leilung luahtu zawng zawngte hi eng mah lova ngaih an ni a; vân sipai rualte zîngah leh leilung luahtute zîngah chuan a thû thûin a ti a. Tu mahin a kut chu an chawlhtîr thei lo va, a hnênah, “Eng nge i tih?” pawh an ti thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutih lai vêk chuan ka hriatna chu ka hnênah a lo kîr leh ta a; tin, ka ram ropuina tûrin ka ropuina leh mawina chu ka hnênah a lo kîr leh a. Ka remruatpuite leh ka mi ropuite chuan min rawn pan leh a, ka ramah chuan tihnghehin ka awm a, ropuina nasa tak mai ka hnênah belhchhah a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tichuan, kei Nebukadnezzara hian vân Lal chu ka fak a, ka chawisâng a, ka zah a; a thiltih zawng zawng chu a dikin a kawngte chu a fel si a. Chapova lêngte chu a tihniam thei a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Belsazzara chuan a mi ropui sângkhatte tân ruai ropui tak a ṭheh a, sâng hmaah chuan uain a in a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Belsazzara chuan uain a in deuh chinah chuan rangkachak leh tangkaraw bungbêl, a pa Nebukadnezzaran Jerusalem-a biak in ata a lâk chhuah chu rawn la tûrin thu a pe a; lal leh a mi ropuite leh a nupuite leh a hmeiten uain an inna atân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, rangkachak bungbêl, Jerusalem-a Pathian biak in ata lâk chhuahte chu an rawn la a; tin lal leh a mi ropuite, a nupuite, a hmeite chuan in nân an hmang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Uain chu an in a, rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te, thîr te, thing te, lungtea siam pathiante chu an chawimawi dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi lai tak chuan mihring kut zungṭang hi a lo chhuak a, lal in bang chulh, khâwnvâr dahna ep lamah chuan a rawn ziak ta a; tin, lal chuan a ziaktu kut tumbung chu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chu a hmêl a dâng a, a rilrute chu a buai zo va, a kâwngruh chuktuahte a zâwi zo va, a khûpte a inkhâwng hlawk hlawk ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal chu, “Aikaihthiamte, Kaldai mite, aisânthiamte rawn hruai tûr,” tiin a au vak a. Tin, lal chuan Babulon mi fingte hnênah chuan, “Tu pawh he ziak hi chhiara a hrilhfiahna mi entîr chu puan sen duk sintîr a ni ang a, a nghâwngah rangkachak khaidiat awrhtîr a ni bawk ang a, rama rorêltu pathumte zînga pakhat a ni ang,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, lal mi fingte zawng zawng chu an lo lût a; mahse, ziak chu an chhiar thei lo va, a hrilhfiahna lah lal an hriattîr thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lal Belsazzara chu a mangang êm êm mai a, a hmêl a dâng a, a mi ropuite chu an mangang bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal leh a mi ropuite au thâwm avâng chuan lalnu chu ruaiṭhehna inah chuan a lo lût a. Lalnu chuan, “Aw lalber, kumkhuain dam ang che! I rilru chu buai suh sela, i hmêl pawh dâng hek suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I ramah hian mi pakhat, amaha pathian thianghlimte thlarau awm chu a awm a; i pa hun laiahte pawh ênna te, hriat thiamna te, finna te, pathian finna ang mai amahah chuan a awm tih hriat a ni tawh a; aw lalber, i pa Lal Nebukadnezzara, i pa ngei chuan dawivaihthiamte, aikaihthiamte, Kaldai mite, aisânthiamte hotuah a siam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />amahah chuan rilru ṭha fawr bîk te, hriatna te, hriat thiamna te, mumang hrilhfiahna te, thu har tihfiahna te, dawi sût thiamna te chu Daniela, lalin Beltesazzara a vuahah chuan a awm tih hriat a ni tawh ṭhîn a. Tûnah Daniela chu koh ni sela, a hrilhfiahna chu a entîr mai ang,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Daniela chu lal hmaah an rawn hruai lût a. Lal chuan Daniela hnênah, “Daniela, Juda sal tâng fate zînga mi, ka pa lalberin Judai ram ata a rawn hruaia chu i ni em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmahah chuan pathiante thlarau a awm a, ênna te, hriat thiamna te, finna ṭha fawr bîk te nangmahah chuan a awm tih hriat a ni, tiin i thu ka lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, tûnah hian he ziak hi chhiar tûr leh a hrilhfiahna mi hriattîr tûrin mi fingte, aikaihthiamte ka hmaah an rawn hruai lût tawh a; mahse, chu thil hrilhfiahna chu mi entîr thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang erawh chuan mi hrilhfiah thei a, dawi i sût thiam a ni tih ka lo hria che a; tûnah i theih chuan ziak hi chhiar la, a hrilhfiahna mi hriattîr la, puan sen duk sintîr i ni ang a, i nghâwng vêlin rangkachak khaidiat awrhtîr i ni ang a, rama rorêltu pathumte zînga pakhat i ni ang,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Daniela chuan a chhâng a, lal hmaah chuan, “I thilpêk chu nangma tân ni sela, i lâwmman chu mi dang hnênah pe ang che; mahse, ziak hi lal ka chhiarsak ang a, a hrilhfiahna chu ka hriattîr ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw lalber, Pathian Chungnungbera chuan i pa Nebukadnezzara chu ram te, lenna te, ropuina te, lalna te a pe a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />lenna a hnêna a pêk avâng chuan mi tinte, hnam tinte, ṭawng tinte chuan an hlau va, a hmaah chuan an khûr ṭhîn a; a duh apiang a that a, a duh apiang a nun a; a duh apiang a chawisâng a, a duh apiang a titlâwm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mahse, a thinlung a lo dâk sâng a, a rilru a lo sak a, chapo takin a che ta a; a lalṭhutthlêng ata tihtlâwm a ni a, a ropuina chu an lâksak ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tin, mihring fate zîng ata hnawh chhuahin a awm a, a rilru chu ramsa anga siam a ni a, a chênna chu ram sabengtungte zîngah a ni ta a; sebâwng angin hlobetin an châwm a, a taksa chu vân daia huhin a awm a, Pathian, Chungnungbera chuan mihringte lalna ram chungah thu a nei a, a duhsak apiang a luahtîr ṭhîn a ni tih a hriat hma loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, nang a fapa, aw Belsazzar, hêng zawng zawng hi i hre na a, i rilru i tihniam lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />vân Lalpa chungah chuan i inchawisâng ta zâwk a; a ina bungbêlte chu i hmaah an rawn la a, nang leh i mi ropuite, i nupuite leh i hmeite nên uain in nân in hmang a; tin, tangkarua te, rangkachak te, dâr te, thîr te, thing te, lungtea siam pathian, hmu thei lo, ngaithla thei lo, hre thei lote chu i chawimawi a; tin, Pathian, i nunna leh i kawng zawng zawng a kuta kawltu chu i zah lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tichuan, a hnên aṭangin kut tumbung chu tirh a ni ta a, he ziak hi a lo inziak ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, hei hi thu ziaka chu a ni e: MENE, MENE, TEKEL, UPHARSIN.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, hei hi a hrilhfiahna chu a ni. MENE: Pathianin i ram chu a chhût zo ta a, a tâwp a thlen ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />TEKEL: Bûkin i awm a, i tling ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />PERES: I ram chu ṭhenin a awm a, Media leh Persia hnênah pêk a ni ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, Belsazzara chuan thu a pe a, Daniela chu puan sen duk an sintîr a, a nghâwng vêlin rangkachak khaidiat an awrhtîr a, a ramah chuan rorêltu pathumte zînga pakhat a ni tûr a ni, tiin an puang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chumi zânah chuan Kaldai lal Belsazzara chu thah a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Daria, Media mi chuan ram chu a chang ta a, amah chu kum sawmruk leh kum hnih vêla upa a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Daria chuan ram awp tûra thuneitu za leh sawmhnih, ram pum puia dah darh chu ṭha a ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, an chungah chuan hotu pathum a ruat leh a, an zînga pakhat chu Daniela a ni a; hêng thuneitute hian an hnêna chanchin an thlen chhâwn zêla, Darian chhiatna rêng a neih loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, he Daniela hi rilru ṭha fawr bîk pu a nih avângin hotu dangte leh thuneitute aiin a lang bîk hle a; lal pawhin ram pum pui chunga dah a rilrûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, hotute leh thuneitute chuan ram chung thûah chuan Daniela chungah remchâng an zawng ta a; mahse, remchâng rêng an hmu thei lo va, dik lohna an hmu thei hek lo; a rinawm êm êm si avângin amahah chuan tihsual emaw, dik lohna emaw hmuh tûr a awm si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, hêng mite hian, “A Pathian dân thûah a chunga remchâng kan hmuh nghâl loh chuan, he Daniela chungah hian remchâng kan hmu dâwn lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, hotute leh thuneitute chu lal hnênah chuan an inhâwr khâwm a, hetiang hian an sawi a: “Lal Daria, kumkhuain dam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram hotute, aiawhtute leh thuneitute, remruattu leh awptute zawng zawng chu ni sawmthum chhûnga aw lalber, nangma hnênah chauh lo chuan, pathian emaw, mihring emaw hnêna dîlna nei apiang chu sakeibaknei pûka paih tûr, tiin lal hian dân siamin khap tlat sela, tih an remti tlâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tûnah hian, aw lalber, khapna chu tinghet la, Media leh Persia dân danglam ngai lo ang zêlin, thu ziak hi danglam leh tawh hlek lo tûrin hming ziak hnan ang che,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Daria chuan thu ziak leh khapnaah chuan hming a ziak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Daniela chuan thu ziak chu hming ziak hnan a ni tih a hriat veleh a inah a lût a (a pindana a tukverhte chu Jerusalem lam hawia hawn a ni a), a hmaa a tih dân ang bawkin ni khatah vawi thum a ṭhingṭhi a, a ṭawngṭai a, a Pathian hnênah lâwmthu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, hêng mite hi an inkhâwm a, Danielan a Pathian hnênah dîlna leh ngenna a hlân ṭhîn tih an hmu chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, lal chu an rawn hnaih a, a hmaah chuan lal khapna thu kha an sawi a. “Ni sawmthum chhûnga aw lalber, nangma hnênah chauh lo chuan pathian emaw, mihring emaw hnêna dîlna nei apiang chu sakeibaknei pûkah paih an ni ang, tia khapnaah khân hming i ziak lâwm ni kha?” an ti a. Lal chuan, “Chu thil chu a nghet e, Media leh Persia dân danglam ngai lo ang zêlin,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chu an chhâng a, “Daniela, Juda sal tâng fate zînga mi khân, aw lalber, a pawisa lo chia, khapna hming i ziak hnan pawh kha a pawisa hek lo; ni khatah vawi thum dîlna a nei zâwk a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan hêng thu hi a hriat chuan pawi a ti êm êm a, Daniela chu chhan chhuah a rilrûk tlat a, chhan chhuak tûrin ni tlâk thlengin a bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, hêng mite hi lal hnênah chuan an rawn inhâwr khâwm leh a, lal hnênah chuan, “Aw lalber, Media leh Persia dânin khapna emaw, dân emaw, lalberin a tihngheh tawh chu a danglam ngai lo tih hria ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chuan thu a pe ta a. Daniela chu an rawn hruai a, sakeibaknei pûkah chuan an paih ta a. Lal chuan Daniela hnênah, “I Pathian, a rawng i bâwl fo ṭhina khân a chhanhim ang che,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, lung an rawn la a, pûk kawngka chu an khâr a; tin, lal chuan Daniela chung thu hi a danglam tawh hlek loh nân ama zungbun ngei leh a mi ropuite zungbuna nemin a chhinchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, lal chu a inah chuan a kal a, chaw ngheiin a zankhua a; a hmaah chuan thil ri theite an rawn la hek lo va, mutmu pawh a tuah thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, a tûk zîng takah chuan lal chu a tho va, hmanhmawh takin sakeibaknei pûk lamah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Daniela awmna pûk a rawn hnaih chuan ṭah awin a au va. Lalber chuan Daniela hnênah, “Aw Daniel, Pathian nung chhiahhlawh, i Pathian, a rawng i bâwl fo ṭhina chuan sakeibaknei lak ata a chhan chhuak thei che em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Daniela chuan lal hnênah, “Aw lalber, kumkhuain dam ang che!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka Pathian chuan a vântirhkoh a rawn tîr a, sakeibaknei kâte a tichîp a, eng mah mi tina lo ve; a mit hmuhah chuan sawisêl bovin ka awm a; tin, i chungah pawh aw lalber, pawi eng mah ka khawih lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chu a lâwm ta êm êm a, Daniela chu pûk ata lâk chhuah tûr thu a pe ta a. Chutichuan, Daniela chu pûk ata an la chhuak a, na lai rêng rêng amahah a awm lo va, a Pathian a rin tlat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan thu a pe a, Daniela hêktute chu an rawn hruai a, sakeibaknei pûkah chuan an paih lût ta a, anniho leh an fate leh an nupuite nên; sakeibakneite chuan anni chu an ching nawk nawk a, an ruhte chu an titliak sawm vek a, pûk mawng pawh an thleng hman lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, Lal Daria chuan mi tinte, hnam tinte, ṭawng tinte zawng zawng, lei pum puia chêngte hnênah chuan lehkha a ziak a, “In chungah remna tihpunin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka ram awp zawng zawngah hian miten Daniela Pathian chu hlauvin khûr rawh se, tiin thupêk ka siam e. Ani chu Pathian nung a ni a, a nghet kumkhua a, a ram chu tihchhiat rual a ni lo vang a, awp pawh a tâwp thleng zakin a awp dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhanhim a, a chhan chhuak a, lei leh vânah hian chhinchhiahnate leh thilmakte a ti a; ani hi sakeibaknei thiltihtheihna lak ata Daniela chhan chhuaktu chu a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, he Daniela hi Daria rorêl lai leh Persia mi Kura rorêl lai chuan a hmuingîl ta hle a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon lal Belsazzara kum khatnaah chuan, Danielan mumang a neiin a khumlaizâwla a lua inlârnate chu a hmu a. Tichuan, a mumang chu a ziak a, a tlângpuiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Daniela chuan a sawi a: “Zânah inlârnaah chuan hmuh ka nei a, ngai teh, kâwlkil lia thli hi tuipui ropui tak chungah a lo tleh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, tuipuiah chuan sa ropui tak tak pali, inang lo tak tak hi an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pakhatna chu sakeibaknei ang a ni a, mupui thla a nei a. A thlate chu thlawn a niha, lei ata chawi kân a niha, mihring anga ke pahniha ding tûra siam a niha, mihring thinlung pêk a nih thlengin ka en reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, sa dang, a pahnihna chu savawm ang a ni a, a khing lehlamin a ding a, a kaah chuan nâk ruh pathum a awm a, a seh kawh a, a hnênah chuan, ‘Tho la, tîsa ei ṭeuh rawh,’ tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan ka en a, ngai teh, a dang, keitê ang, a hnunga sava thla pali nei a lo awm a, chu sa chuan lû pali a nei a; tin, a hnênah chuan rorêlna pêk a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan, zân inlârnaahte chuan ngai teh, sa palina, ṭihbaiawm leh hlauhawm tak, chak tak mai ka hmu a; thîr ha ropui tak a nei a; a ei buan buan a, a pawt sawm a, a bângnawite chu a kein a rap bet a. A hmaa sa dangte lakah kha chuan danglam tak a ni; ki sâwm a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kîte chu ka ngaihtuah a; tin, ngai teh, an zîng aṭang chuan ki dang pakhat, tê tak tê a lo chawr chhuak a; a hmaah chuan ki hmasa pathumte chu a bul rêtah an thlawn ta a: tin, ngai teh, he kîah hian mitte, mihring mit ang mai hi a awm a; tin, kâ pawh a awm a, thil nasa takte a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêngte an han hûn chhuaha, mi pakhat, Hmâkhawsânga a ṭhut thlengin ka en reng a; a silhfênte chu vûr anga vâr a ni a, a sam chu sahmul thianghlim tak ang a ni. A lalṭhutthlêng chu mei alh a ni a, chumi tawlailîr chu mei kâng mêk ang a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A hma aṭang chuan mei lui a lo chhuakin a luang a. A sânga sângin rawng an bâwlsak a, a hmaah chuan sîng hmun sîng an ding a: rorêlna a lo awm ta a, lehkhabute chu keu a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan kîin thu nasa tak a sawi thâwm avâng chuan ka han en a, sa chu tihhluma, a taksa tihchhiata, meia hâl tûra pêk a nih thlengin ka en reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, sa dangte thu kha chu, an rorêlna lâksakin an awm a, an nunna erawh chu hunbi khat leh hun khat chhûng atân zuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zân inlârnaahte chuan, ngai teh, vân chhûmte nêna lo kal, mi pakhat, mihring fapa ang hi ka hmu a, Hmâkhawsânga hnênah chuan a lo kal a, a hmaah chuan ani chu an rawn hruai hnai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, rorêlna te, ropuina te, ram te a hnêna pêk a ni a, mi tin te, hnam tin te leh ṭawng tinte zawng zawng chuan a rawng an bâwl nân. A rorêlna chu rorêlna hlun, ral ngai lo tûr a ni a, a ram chu tihchhiat rual a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Kei Daniela hi, ka taksa chhûngah hian ka rilru a lungngai a, ka lua inlârnate chuan mi tibuai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A lo dingte zînga pakhat chu ka han hnaih a, hêng zawng zawng chungchânga thutak chu ka zâwt a. Chutichuan, mi hrilh a, a thil hrilhfiahnate pawh chu mi hriattîr ta a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Hêng sa ropui tak tak palite hi, lal pali lei ata lo chhuak tûrte chu an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mahse, Chungnungbera mi thianghlimte chuan ram chu an chang ang a, kumkhuain, kumkhaw tlaitluanin.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, sa palina, a dangte laka danglam bîk tak, ṭihbaiawm tak, a hâte thîr nia, a tinte dâr nia, ei buan buana, pawt sawma, a bângnawi a ke hnuaia rap bettu chungchângah chuan thutak hriat ka châk ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a lua ki sâwm leh ki dang lo chhuaka, a hmaa pathum tlu ta chungchâng te; kha kî, mitte neia, thil nasa tak sawitu, kâ pawh neia, a lan dân pawh a ṭhiante aia ropui bîk tak te nên khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ka en reng a; chu kî ngei chuan mi thianghlimte chu a do va, a hneh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmâkhawsânga a lo kala, rorêlna chu Chungnungbera mi thianghlimte hnênah pêk a niha, mi thianghlimten ram an chan hun a lo thlen hma loh chuan a hneh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hetiang hian a ti a: ‘Sa palina chu lei chung ram palina, ram dang zawng zawng laka danglam bîk, lei pum pui ei buan buana, chîla, pawt sawm tûr chu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Ki sâwmte thu chu, hemi ram ata hi lal sâwm an lo chhuak dâwn a ni. An hnuah chuan pakhat a lo chhuak ang a, a hmaa mite lakah chuan a danglam ang a, lal pathumte chu a titlu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chungnungbera kalhin thu a sawi ang a, Chungnungbera mi thianghlimte a tichau vang; hunte leh dân chu tihdanglam a tum ang a, hun khat leh hunte leh hun chanve chhûng chu a kuta pêk an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mahse, rorêlna a lo awm ang a, a thuneihna chu tihrala tihchhiat hlen tûrin an la bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, ram leh rorêlna leh vân pum pui hnuaia ramte ropuina chu Chungnungbera mi thianghlimte hnênah chuan pêk a ni ang. A ram chu ram hlun a ni a, awp ram zawng zawngin a rawng an bâwl ang a, a thu an âwih ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hei hi thil tâwpna chu a ni. Kei Daniela hi ka ngaihtuahnate chuan mi tibuai a, ka hmêl a dâng a; mahse, ka rilruin thu chu ka vawng reng a ni.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Belsazzara rorêl kum thumnaah chuan ka hnênah, kei Daniela hnên ngeiah hian inlârna a lo lang a, a tîra ka hnêna lo lang hnuah khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Inlârnaah chuan hmuh ka nei a; hetiang hi a ni a, ka hmuh lai chuan Elam biala Susan lal inah ka lo awm a; tin, inlârnaah chuan hmuh ka nei a, Ulai lui kamah ka lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, ka mit ka han lên chho va, ka han en a, ngai teh, lui bulah chuan berâmpa, ki pahnih nei hi a ding a; tin, ki pahnihte chu an sâng dûn hle a; mahse, pakhat chu a dang ai chuan a sâng zâwk a, a sâng zâwka chu a lo chawr hnuhnûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Berâmpa chuan thlang lam leh hmâr lam leh chhim lam phînin ka hmu a; a hmaah chuan sa rêng rêng ding thei an awm lo va, a kut ata chhan chhuak thei an awm hek lo; a duh ang angin a che a, amah a intilian a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ka ngaihtuah mêk laiin, ngai teh, khawthlang lam aṭangin lei pum pui chungah hian kêlpa a lo thawk a, lei pawh a khawih lo; tin, kêl chuan a mit inkârah ki langsâr tak a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, berâmpa, ki pahnih nei, lei bula ding ka hmuh kha a rawn pan a, a chak theihtâwpin a zuan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, berâmpa chu a fin rawkin ka hmu a, a chungah a thinur êm êm a, berâmpa chu a tauh va, a ki pahnih chu a tihtliahsak a, amah khing tûrin berâmpaah chuan chakna rêng rêng a awm ta lo; leiah a theh thlu a, a rap bet a, berâmpa chu a kut ata chhan chhuak thei rêng rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, kêlpa chu a intilian ta vak mai a; a chak lai tak chuan a ki ropui chu a tliak ta a, a aiah chuan ki langsâr tak pali, kâwlkil li hawiin an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, an zînga pakhatah chuan ki tê tak tê a lo pêng chhuak a, chhim lamah te, chhak lamah te, ram ropui lamah te nasa takin a lo ṭhang lian ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, vâna awmho tawng hialin a lo ṭhang lian a, chûng awmho ṭhenkhatte leh arsi ṭhenkhatte chu leiah a paih thla a, a rap bet ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ni, chûng awmho lal thleng hialin a intilian a, hâlral thilhlan awm fo chu a lâk bosak a, a hmun thianghlim awmna chu tihchhiatin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chûng awmho chu hâlral thilhlan awm fo chawp chuan bawhchhiatna avângin a hnênah pêk a ni a; tin, thutak chu leiah a paih thla a, chutiangin a ti a, a hlawhtling hle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, mi thianghlim ṭawng ka hria a; tin, mi thianghlim dangin tu emaw lo ṭawnga hnênah khân, “Hâlral thilhlan awm fo te, tiṭiautu bawhchhiatna te, hmun thianghlim leh awmho chu rah beh tûra pêk an nih te chungchânga inlârna chu engtia rei nge ni dawn?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Zîng leh tlai sânghnih leh zathum thlengin; tichuan, hmun thianghlim chu then fai a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kei Daniela ngei hian inlârna chu ka hmuhin a awmzia hriat ka tum a; tin, ngai teh, ka hmaah chuan mihring anga lang hi a lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Ulai kam tuak inkârah chuan mihring aw, “Gabriel, inlârna chu he mi hi hriat thiamtîr rawh,” tia han ko hi ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka dinna chu a rawn hnaih a; tin, a lo kal chuan ka hlau êm a, bawkkhupin ka tlu a; mahse, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Aw mihring fapa, hre thiam ang che, inlârna chu tâwpna huna mi tûr a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, mi biak lai chuan bawkkhupin ka lo muhîl dêr a; mahse, mi han khawih a, mi dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ngai rawh, thinurna hun hnuhnûng lama thil lo awm tûr chu ka hriattîr ang che; tâwpna hun ruata mi a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Berâmpa, ki pahnih nei i hmuh kha Media leh Persia lal an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tin, kêlpa hmul chhur mai chu Grik lal a ni: tin, a mit inkâra ki ropui chu lal hmasa ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, kha kî, tliaka a hmuna pali lo chhuak kha chu, chu hnam aṭang chuan ram pali a lo ding chhuak dâwn tihna a ni a, a thiltihtheihna nên erawh chuan ni lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, an lalna hun hnuhnûng lama bawhchhetuten an vâwrtâwp an thlen hunah chuan, lal hmêl hlauhawm tak, thu khirhkhân thiam mi a lo chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a thuneihna a chak êm êm ang a, ama thiltihtheihna ngei avâng erawh chu ni lovin; mak takin a tichhia ang a, a hlawhtling ang a, chutiangin a ti ang; tin, mi chakte leh mi thianghlimte chu a tichhia ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a thiltih dâwn avângin vervêkna a kutah a tihlawhtling ang; a thinlungah amah a intilian ang a, ngaihṭha taka an awm laiin tam tak a tichhia ang. Lalte Lal a khing ang a; mahse, kut lova tihtliahin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, zîng lam leh tlai lam inlârna, sawi tawha kha, a dik a ni; mahse, inlârna chu ngawihpui rawh, ni tam tak hnua mi tûr a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, kei Daniela chu ka chau va, ni eng emaw zât ka damlo va; tin, ka tho va, lal hna chu ka thawk leh ta a. Tin, inlârna chu mak ka ti êm êm mai a; mahse, tu mân an hre thiam lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahasuera fapa Daria, Media chia mi, Kaldai ram chunga lala siam kum khatna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a rorêl kum khatnaah chuan, kei Daniela hian lehkhabuahte chuan zâwlnei Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng, Jerusalem chhiatna hlen a tiam hun chhûng kum zât chu ka lo hre thiam ta a, kum sawmsarih chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chaw ngheiin, saiip puan te, vaivut te nên ṭawngṭaina leh dîlna zawngin Lalpa Pathian lam chu ka hawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa ka Pathian hnênah chuan ka ṭawngṭai a, ka inpuang a, “Aw Lalpa, Pathian ropui tak leh ṭihawm tak, nangmah hmangaiha, i thupêkte zâwm ṭhîntu hnêna thuthlung leh zahngaihna nei ṭhîntu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I thupêk leh rorêlnate laka kal pêngin kan sual ta a, dik lo tak leh suaksual takin kan ti ta a, kan hel ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan lalte, hotute leh pate leh ram mipui zawng zawngte hnêna i hminga thusawitu, i chhiahhlawh zâwlneite chu kan ngaithla hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Lalpa, felna chu i chan a ni a, keini chan erawh chu zahna mai a ni, tûnlai ang hian; Judai-a mite, Jerusalem-a chêngte, Israel-ho zawng zawng, lamhnaia mi leh lamhlaa mi, an bawhchhiatna, i chunga an bawhchhiatnate avânga ram tina i hnawh darhte lah chuti bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa, i chunga kan lo sual tâk avângin keini chan zawng zahna mai a ni, kan lalte, kan hotute, kan pate chan pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zahngaihna leh ngaihdamna chu Lalpa kan Pathian chuan a nei, a chungah hel ta mah ila.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh zâwlneite hmanga kan hmaa a dah, a dânte zâwmin Lalpa kan Pathian aw chu kan âwih hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ni, Israel-ho zawng zawngin i aw âwih lo tûra kal pêngin i dân an bawhchhe ta a ni. Chuvâng chuan ânchhia chu kan chungah leihin a awm ta a, Pathian chhiahhlawh Mosia dâna ziak chhechham thu nên; a chungah kan sual ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a thu kan chunga a sawi leh kan rorêltu, ro min rêltute chunga a sawi kha kan chunga thil ṭha lo nasa tak thlentîrin a tikim ta a; Jerusalem chunga tih tâk ang chu vân hnuai pum puiah pawh tihin a awm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosia dâna ziak angin hêng thil ṭha lo zawng zawngte hi kan chungah a lo thleng a ni; mahse, kan khawlohnate chu kan hawisana, i thu dik hriat thiamna te kan neih nân Lalpa kan Pathian lungawina chu kan zawng si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan thil ṭha lo chu a en reng a, kan chungah a rawn thlentîr ta a ni; Lalpa kan Pathian chu a thiltih a tih zawng zawngah hian a fel si a, a aw kan âwih ta lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, tûnah hian, aw Lalpa kan Pathian, Aigupta ram ata kut chaka i mite hruai chhuaktu leh hmingthanna, tûn thlenga hming ṭhatna insiamtu, kan sual ta a, suaksual takin kan ti ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Lalpa, ka ngên a che, i felna zawng zawng avângin i thinurna leh i thinrimna chu i khawpui Jerusalem, i tlâng thianghlim aṭang chuan kîr sela; kan sualte avâng leh kan pate khawlohna avângin, Jerusalem leh i mite hi kan vêla mi zawng zawngte zîngah sawi chhiat a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw kan Pathian, tûnah hian i chhiahhlawh ṭawngṭaina leh dîlnate hi ngaithla la, Lalpa avângin i hmun thianghlim ram tawh chungah chuan i hmêl tieng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, i beng dawh la, ngaithla teh; i mit meng la, kan ṭiau dânte leh khawpui i hming vuaha awm hi en teh; kan dîlnate chu kan felnate avângin i hmaah kan hlân a ni si lo va, i zahngaihna ropui tak avângin a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa, ngaithla teh; aw Lalpa, ngaidam rawh; aw Lalpa, ngaithla la, thawk ang che; rial suh ang che, aw ka Pathian, nangmah avâng ngeiin i khawpui leh i mite i hming vuaha an awm avângin,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, keima sual leh ka mi Israel-te sual thupha chawia, ṭawngṭaia, thu sawia, Lalpa ka Pathian hmaa ka Pathian tlâng thianghlim atâna dîlna ka hlan lai mêkin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a ni, ṭawngṭaia ka ṭawng lai ngei chuan, mi, Gabriela, a tîra inlârnaa ka hmuh khân, tlai lam thilhlan hun lai angah hian chak taka thlâwkin mi rawn pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, hriat thiamna mi neihtîr a, mi bia a, ka hnênah, “Aw Daniel, hriat thiamna fing tak neihtîr tûr chein ka lo chhuak a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I dîl tirhah khân thupêk a chhuak tawh a, hrilh tûr chein ka lo kal a ni, duhawm tak i ni si a; chuvâng chuan thil chu ngaihtuah la, inlârna chu hre thiam rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawhchhiatna tikin tûr te, sualna titâwp tûr te, khawlohna thian fai tûr te, chatuan felna la lût tûr te, inlârna leh thu hrilhlâwk nêna chhinchhiah tûr te, hmun thianghlim ber chu hriak thih tûr tein i mite leh i khawpui thianghlim tân hapta sawmsarih ruat a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvângin, Jerusalem tung ding leh sa ṭha tûra thupêk a chhuah aṭanga Hriakthiha, lal a lo awm thlengin hapta sarih a ni ang tih hre fiah thiam ang che; tin, hapta sawmruk leh pahnihah kawtthlêr leh lei rût te nên siam a ni ang, hun buaithlâk takahte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, hapta sawmruk leh pahnih hnuah chuan Hriakthiha chu tihbo a ni ang a, eng mah a nei tawh lo vang; tin, lal lo kal tûra mite chuan khawpui leh hmun thianghlim chu an tichhia ang. A tâwpna chu tui lian nên a ni ang a, a tâwpna thleng pawhin indona a awm ang, chhiatnate chu a inruat sa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, hapta khat atân mi tam tak hnênah thuthlung nghet tak a siam ang a; hapta chanveah chuan inthawinate leh thilhlante a tibâng ang; tin, tiṭiautu chu tenawmna thla chunga chuangin a lo kal ang a, tâwpna, lo thleng ngei tûra ruat sa thleng chuan thinurna chu tiṭiautu chungah chuan leihbuak a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Persia lal Kura kum thumnaah chuan, Daniela, a hming Beltesazzara an vuah hnênah chuan thil a lo lang a. Chu thil chu a dik a ni a, chu chu indona ropui tak a ni; tichuan, thil chu a hre thiam a, inlârna hriat theihna a nei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chûng nîahte chuan kei Daniela chu hapta thum pumhlûm lusûn angin ka awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chaw tuihnai rêng rêng ka ei lo va, sa emaw, uain emaw pawh ka kaah a lût hek lo, hapta thum pumhlûm a kim hma chu hriak pawh ka inthih hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, thla khatna, ni sawmhnih leh ni li nia lui ropui tak Hiddekel kama ka awm lai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ka mit ka han lên chho va; ngai teh, mi, puanzaisîna inthuam, a kâwnga Uphaz rangkachak thianghlima inhrêng hi a lo awm a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A taksa pawh berul lung ang a ni a, a hmêl chu kâwlphe lan dân ang, a mitte chu mei khâwnvâr ang, a bânte leh a kephahte chu dâr tle mi ang, a ṭawng thâwm chu mipui thâwm ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu inlârna chu kei Daniela chauh hian ka hmu a, ka hnêna awmte chuan inlârna chu an hmu ve lo va; mahse, nasa takin an lo khûr a, an biru bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, keimah chauh ka awm ta a, inlârna ropui tak chu ka hmu a, thahrui rêng ka nei ta lo va; ka hmêl mawina pawh a chuai zo va, thahrui rêng ka nei ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mahse, a ṭawng ri chu ka hria a; a ṭawng ri ka han hriat chuan bawkkhupin hmai lei siin ka muhîl ta dêr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, kut hian mi han khawih a, chu chuan mi bawhvahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Aw Daniel, nang mi duhawm tak, i hnêna ka thusawi hi hre thiam la, ding ngîl rawh; tûnah hian i hnêna rawn tirh ka ni si a,” a ti a; tin, he thu hi ka hnêna a sawi zawh chuan khûr chungin ka ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Hlau suh Daniel, i Pathian hmaa inngaitlâwm tûr leh hre thiam tûra i thinlung i pêk tirh ni aṭang khân i thute chu ngaihthlâk a ni a, i thute avâng chuan ka lo kal a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mahse, Persia ram hotu chuan ni sawmhnih leh ni khat mi dodâl a; amaherawhchu, ngai teh, Mikaela, hotu lian chu min pui tûrin a lo kal a; tichuan, Persia lal hnênah chuan ka han awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nakin lama i mite chunga thil lo thleng tûrte hriat thiamtîr tûr chein tûnah hian ka lo kal a ni, Inlârna chu ni tam tak hnuah a la ni dâwn si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, hêng thute ka hnêna a sawi hnu chuan kei chu ka kaikûn a, ka ṭawng thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, mi pakhat, mihring fapate ang taka lang hian ka hmui a rawn khawih a; tichuan, ka kâ ka âng ta a, ka hmaa lo dinga hnênah chuan, “Aw ka lalpa, inlârna avâng chuan ka lungngaihnate chuan mi delh a, thahrui rêng ka nei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />He ka lalpa chhiahhlawh hian he ka lalpa hi engtin nge a biak theih ang? Kei lah chuan thahrui rêng ka nei si lo, thâwk pawh ka la thei hek lo,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, mihring ang taka lang chuan mi han khawih leh a, mi tichak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Aw mi duhawm tak, hlau suh; thlamuang takin awm rawh; chak la, a ni, chak rawh,” a ti a. Tin, ka hnêna thu a sawi lai chuan ka lo chak ta a, “Ka lalpan thu sawi rawh se, nangin mi tichak tawh si a,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan, “I hnêna ka lo kal chhan hi i hria em? Tûnah chuan Persia ram hotu bei tûrin ka kîr dâwn a ni; tin, ka thawh chhuah hunah chuan, ngai teh, Grik ram hotu a lo kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mahse, thu dik ziaknaa ziak chu ka hrilh ang che: hêngah hian in hotu Mikaela chauh lo chu tu mah mi ṭan tûr an awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, kei chu, Media mi Daria kum khatnaah khân amah tinghet tûr leh tichak tûrin ka ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, tûnah hian thu dik chu ka entîr ang che. Ngai teh, Persia ramah chuan lal pathum an lo la chhuak ang a, a palina chu a dang zawng ai khân a hausa zâwk hle ang; a hausakna avânga a intihchak hunah chuan Grik ram do tûrin mi zawng zawng a chawk tho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lal chak tak, thuneihna ropui taka rorêl tûr chu a lo chhuak ang a, a thû thûin a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a lo chhuah hun chuan a ram chu phel darh a ni ang a, kâwlkil liah semin a awm ang, a thlahte hnênah ni lovin, a thuneihnaa a rêl ṭhin ang zêl ni hek lovin; a ram chu he mite ni lo, mi dang tân chhuhsakin a awm zâwk dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, chhim lam lal chu a chak ang a; a hotute zînga pakhat erawh chu amah aiin a chak zâwk ang a, thuneihna a nei ang a, a thuneihna chu thuneihna ropui tak a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, kumte tâwpah chuan an inzawm ang a; chhim lam lal fanu chu hmâr lam lal hnênah inremna siam tûrin a lo kal ang; mahse, a chakna chu a nei rei lo vang a, ani pawh kha a ding hek lo vang a, a chakna pawh; lal fanu chu pêk bovin a awm zâwk ang a, a rawn hruaitute leh a hringtu, chutih laia amah tichaktu nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mahse, a zung aṭanga chawr no ata chu mi pakhat ama hmunah a ding ang a, chu chu sipai rual nên a lo kal ang a, hmâr lam lal kulhah chuan a lût ang a, anmahni a bei ang a, a hneh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, an pathiante, an lim chhûnte nên, an tangkarua leh rangkachak bungbêl ṭha tak takte nên, Aigupta ramah a kalpui vek ang a; tin, kum eng emaw ti chu hmâr lam lal lakah a châwl rih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chhim lam lalramah chuan hmâr lam lal chu a lo lût ang a; mahse, ama ramah a kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a fapaten an do vang a, sipai rual nasa tak an ko khâwm ang a, an lo kal ang a, an chîm hneh ang a, an pal tlang ang; tin, an lo kîr ang a, an do vang a, a kulh ngei pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chhim lam lal chu a thinur êm êm ang a, a lo chhuakin amah a bei ang - hmâr lam lal ngei chu; tin, mipui tam tak nên a chhuak ang a, mi tam tak a kutah pêk a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, mi tam tak chu hruai bo an ni ang a, a thinlung a sâng ang a, sîng laite chu a titlu ang a; mahse, a ding hlen lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, hmâr lam lal chu a lo thawk leh ang a, mipui a hmaa mi aia tam zâwk nên a chhuak ang a; tin, hun tâwp kum tâwp ngeiah chuan sipai rual nasa tak leh thuam nasa tak nên a rawn pan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, chûng hunahte chuan mi tam tak, chhim lam lal do tûrin an ding ang. I chite zînga pâwngnêk mite pawh inlârna chu tithleng tûrin an inlek ang a; mahse, an tlu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmâr lam lal chu a lo kal ang a, mual pâwng a siam ang a, khawpui kulh nghet nei chu a la ang; tin, chhim lam chakna chuan a dâl zo lo vang, a mi thlante pawhin; dâl zo tûr chakna rêng a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, a rawn dotu chuan a duh ang angin a ti ang a, a hmaah tu mah an ding lo vang. Tin, ani chu ram ropuiah chuan a ding ang a, a kutah chhiatna a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a ram pum pui chakna nêna lo kal a tum ang a, inremna a siam ang a, chutiangin a ti ang; tin, a tihkhawloh tûrin a hnênah hmeichhe fanu a pe ang a; mahse, a hlawhtling lo vang a, a hlâwkpui hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hemi hnuah hi chuan thliarkâr lam a hawi ang a, tam tak a la ang. Mahse, hotu pakhat chuan sawichhiatna a chhâk chhuah chu a tibâng ang a; a ni, a sawichhiatna chu ama chung vêkah a lêttîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, ama ram ngei kulhte lam chu a hawi leh ang a; mahse, a petekin a tlu ang a, hmuh zawh a ni tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, ama hmunah chuan mi pakhat, ram ropuinaa chhiahkhawntu kal tlangtîrtu tûr chu a lo ding chhuak ang; mahse, ni rei lo teah thinurna vâng ni lovin, indona vâng pawh ni hek lovin, tihboralin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, a hmunah chuan mi hmuhsitawm, ram chawimawina a pêk loh chu a lo ding chhuak ang; mahse, ram muan laiin a lo kal ang a, ṭawngkam thiamin ram chu a chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, a hmaa mi chu tui lian chaknaa hrût bovin an awm ang a, keh sawmin an awm ang; a ni, thuthlung hotu chenin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, a hnêna thuthlung siam hnuah chuan hlemhle takin a che ang; a lo ding chhuak ang a, mipui tlêm tête nen pawh a lo chak dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Muan hun laiin ram bial ṭha ber berah a lo thawk ang a, a pate leh a pa pate tih ngai loh chu a ti ang: mite zîngah chuan râllâk leh râllâk thilte, sumte a vawrh darh ang; a ni, kulh nghet chungahte chuan a phiarrûkte chu a phiar rih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a thiltihtheihna leh a huaina chu, sipai rual nasa tak nên chhim lam lal chungah a chawk tho vang a; tin, chhim lam lal chuan sipai rual nasa tak leh chak tak nên a lo do vang a; mahse, a ding zo lo vang, a chungah chuan phiarrûk eng eng emaw an lo phiar dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A ni, a chaw tui hmêl eitute ngei chuan amah an tiboral ang a, a sipai rualte chu hnâwl bovin an awm ang a, tam tak chu thahin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, hêng lalte hi zawng an thinlunga pawi khawih hmang an ni ve ve ang a, dawhkân hmun khatah dâwt an sawi ang; mahse, a hlawhtling lo vang, a tâwp chu hun ruatah chuan a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, sum tam tak nên ama ramah a kîr leh ang a, a thinlung chu thuthlung thianghlim dovin a awm ang; chutiangin a ti ang a, ama ram ngeiah a kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hun ruatah chuan a lo lêt leh ang a, chhim lamah a kal ang a; mahse, a hnuhnûng zâwkah hi chuan a hmasa ang chu a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kittim lawngte chuan amah an rawn do dâwn a ni; chutichuan, a lungni lo vang a, a kîr ang a, thuthlung thianghlim chungah chuan a thinur ang a, chutiangin a ti ang; a ni, a kîr leh ang a, thuthlung thianghlim hawisantute chu a lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, sipaite chuan an beihsak ang a, hmun thianghlimte an tibawlhhlawh ang a, kulh ngei pawh chu; tin, hâlral thilhlan awm fo chu a tibo vang a, ṭiauna tenawmna chu an dintîr zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, thuthlung chunga suaksual taka titute chu ṭawngkam thiamin a tikhawlo vang; mahse, mi an Pathian hretute kha chu an nghet ang a, thil nasa tak an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, mi zînga a fingate chuan mi tam tak an zirtîr ang a; mahse, khandaih te, mei alh te, sal tânna te leh rawkrâl tein ni tam tak an tlu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, an tlûk pawhin puihna tlêm têa dawmin an awm ang a; mahse, mi tam takin fak derin anmahni an fin ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, a fingate zînga ṭhenkhatte chuan, anmahni tifai tûr leh tithianghlim tûr leh tivâr tûrin an tlûk phah ang, tâwpna hun thleng pawhin; hun ruatah a la nih fo avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a duh ang angin a ti ang: amah a inchawisâng ang a, pathian tinrêng chungah a intilian ang a, pathiante Pathian kalhin thilmak takte a sawi ang a, thinurna hrîkthlâk zawh a nih hma chu a hlawhtling ang; ruat sa chu tih ngei tûr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A thlahtute pathiante chu a pawisa lo vang a, hmeichhiate ngainat pathiante leh pathian dang rêng rêng pawh a pawisa hek lo vang; mi zawng zawng chungah a intilian dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mahse, chumi aiah chuan kulhte pathian chu a chawimawi ang a, pathian, a pate pawhin an hriat ngai loh kha rangkachak nên, tangkarua nên, lunghlute leh thil duhawmte nên a chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, pathian dang tak ṭanpuinain kulh nghet tak takte chu a bei ang a, tu pawh a pawm apiang chu a tiropui ang; tam tak chungah ro a rêltîr ang a, ram chu man neiin a sem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, tâwpna hunah chuan chhim lam lalin amah a rawn nawr ang a; tin, hmâr lam lal chuan tawlailîr nên, sakawr chung chuang mi leh lawng tam tak nên, ṭhâwngaleivir ang maiin amah a lo bei ang; ramte chu a lût ang a, a chîm hneh ang a, a pal tlang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ram ropui pawh chu a lût ang a, tam tak chu tihtlûk a ni ang; mahse, a kut ata hêng hi chu chhan chhuah an ni ang - Edom leh Moab leh Amon mi ṭha ṭhate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ramte chungah pawh a kut a lek ang a, Aigupta ram pawhin a pumpelh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tichuan, rangkachak leh tangkaraw dah khâwmte chungah leh Aigupta ram thil hlute zawng zawng chungah thu a nei ang; tin, Libua mite leh Ethiopia mite chu a kaihzavêng an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mahse, chhak lam leh hmâr lam aṭanga thuthangin amah a tibuai ang; tichuan, mi tam tak tiboral tûr leh timang tûrin thinur takin a chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, tuipui leh tlâng thianghlim ropui tak inkârah chuan a lal puan in chu a hûng ang a; mahse, a tâwpna a thleng a ni ang a, tu mahin an pui lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chumi hunah chuan i mipui fate ṭan ṭhîntu, hotu ropui tak Mikaela chu a ding ang a; tin, buaina hun, hnam awm tirh ata chumi hun thleng pawha la awm ngai lo chu a lo awm ang; tin, chumi hunah chuan i mite chu chhan chhuahin an awm ang, mi tin lehkhabua hming chuang apiangte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, an zînga tam tak lei vaivuta muhîl tawhte chu an lo ṭhangharh ang a, ṭhenkhat chu chatuan nunnaah, ṭhenkhat zahna leh chatuan hmuhsitawmnaah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a fingate chu vân êng angin an êng ang a, mi tam tak felnaa hawi kîrtîrtute chu arsi angin kumkhaw tlaitluanin an êng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mahse, nang aw Daniel, thu chu thup la, lehkhabu chu châr tlat rawh, tâwpna hun thlengin; mi tam tak an tlân vêl ang a, hriatnate a pung dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, kei Daniela chuan ka han en a, ngai teh, mi dang pahnih an lo ding a, pakhat chu lui kam ko he lamah, a dang chu lui kam ko lehlamah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, tuin emaw, mi, puanzaisîna inthuam, luipui tui chunga awm hnênah chuan, “Hêng thilmak tâwpna hi eng chen nge ni ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, mi puanzaisîna inthuam, luipui tui chunga awm chuan a kut ding lam leh a kut vei lam vân lama phar chhuakin, “Hun khat leh hunte leh hun chanve chhûng a ni ang; mi thianghlimte thiltihtheihna chu an tihkeh sawm zawh hunah hêng thil zawng zawng hi a kin ang,” tia nung kumkhuaa chhâlin chhia a chham ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hriat chu ka hria a, a ngaihna erawh chu ka hre lo; tichuan, kei chuan, “Aw ka lalpa, hêng thil tâwpna hi eng nge ni ang?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Daniel, kal mai rawh, thu chu thup leh châr tlat a ni ta e, tâwpna hun thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tam tak chu an intithianghlimin an intivâr ang a, an lo ṭha ang; mahse, mi suaksualte chuan sual takin an ti ang a, mi suaksual tu mahin a ngaihna an hre lo vang a; mi fingte erawh chuan a ngaihna an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, hâlral thilhlan awm fote lâk bo a niha, ṭiauna tenawm dintîr a nih hun aṭang chuan, ni sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmkua a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nghâk hrâm hrâma, ni sângkhat leh zathum leh sawmthum leh panga thleng zo chu a eng a thâwl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mahse, nang chu tâwpna thleng chuan kal rawh; nite tâwpnaah chuan i châwl ang a, i chan tâwkah chuan i awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
</usx>
